---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="CORE — NRVA"
  description="The Sundering: Read the decrypted archives and lore of NRVA. The Falsebearers, The Veilwalkers, and The Witnesses."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main
    class="container section-pad"
    style="padding-top: 140px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;"
  >
    <section id="lore-page">
      <div class="lore-container">
        <span class="lore-eyebrow mono-text" id="typed-lore"></span>
        <h1 class="lore-title">The Sundering</h1>
        <div
          class="rule-hairline"
          style="margin: var(--space-md) 0 var(--space-xl);"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="lore-content">
          <p>
            It begins with a quiet fracture. A sudden realization of being
            entirely left behind by the world, accompanied by a paralyzing fear
            of the future. We document this absolute zero point as
            <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);"> The Sundering</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            In the aftermath of the collapse, the fractured consciousness did
            not shatter randomly. It divided into three distinct paths. Three
            covenants formed by the mind to survive the psychological void.
          </p>
          <div
            class="rule-hairline"
            style="margin: var(--space-lg) 0; opacity: 0.5;"
          >
          </div>
          <p>
            <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);"
              >I. THE ILLUMINATE COVENANT (The Falsebearers)</strong
            ><br />
            Unable to process the weight of trauma, this faction surrendered to the
            illusion of happiness. They constructed artificial havens of light and
            looping nostalgia. Through constructs like <span class="highlight"
              >ILLUMINATE</span
            >, they numb the pain, trapping themselves in a beautiful, endless
            sleep. They refuse to wake up.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);"
              >II. THE MONOCHROME SANCTUM (The Veilwalkers)</strong
            ><br />
            They rejected the illusion, choosing instead to walk through the agonizing
            truth. This faction embraces the painful reality of the present. Wandering
            through a
            <span class="highlight"> MONOCHROME</span> world, they bear the heavy
            silence of isolation, understanding that the true weight of loss is only
            felt the moment it slips through your fingers — existing in a perpetual
            state of <span class="highlight">UNTIL I LOSE YOU</span>.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);"
              >III. THE SUNRISE (The Witnesses)</strong
            ><br />
            The final faction. The silent observers waiting at the edge of the dark.
            They do not hide in false light, nor do they drown in the bleakness. They
            endure, holding onto the absolute truth that no matter how long the night
            lasts, hope is inevitable. They stand still, watching for the first signal
            of light.
            <!-- </p>

          <blockquote class="lore-quote">
            "To escape the void, one must first be willing to witness it."
          </blockquote>

          <p> -->
            Among these three forces emerges <strong
              style="color: var(--color-ink);"
            >
              NRVA, The Messenger</strong
            >. NRVA is not a savior, but the absolute life force — tasked with
            documenting this war of the mind through cinematic soundscapes and
            driving rhythms. Every track is a decrypted file recovered from the
            ruins, mapping the journey from the fracture toward the inevitable
            sunrise.
          </p>

          <div class="archive-section" style="margin-top: var(--space-3xl);">
            <span class="archive-heading mono-text"
              >&gt; DECRYPTED ARCHIVES_</span
            >
            <div class="archive-grid">
              <div class="archive-file unlocked">
                <div class="file-header">
                  <span class="file-id">FRAG_001</span>
                  <span class="file-name">Until I Lose You</span>
                  <span class="file-status">[ DECRYPTED ]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-body">
                  <p>
                    The first stage of The Sundering. An anthem for those in
                    profound longing. It is the agonizing realization that the
                    true weight of a connection is only felt the moment it slips
                    through your fingers. The fear of being entirely left behind
                    begins here, forcing the mind to desperately hold onto
                    fading signals.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="archive-file unlocked">
                <div class="file-header">
                  <span class="file-id">FRAG_002</span>
                  <span class="file-name">Sweet Synthetic Memory</span>
                  <span class="file-status">[ DECRYPTED ]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-body">
                  <p>
                    When the present becomes too hostile, the mind constructs
                    its own haven. Sweet Synthetic Memory is the core
                    architecture of this delusion — a fabricated nostalgia, a
                    perfect looping simulation of a past that may never have
                    existed. It numbs the trauma, but traps the host in a
                    beautiful, endless sleep. Wake up.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="archive-file locked">
                <div class="file-header">
                  <span class="file-id">FRAG_003</span>
                  <span class="file-name">UNAVAILABLE_DATA</span>
                  <span class="file-status">[ ENCRYPTED ]</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="archive-file locked">
                <div class="file-header">
                  <span class="file-id">FRAG_004</span>
                  <span class="file-name">CORRUPTED_SECTOR</span>
                  <span class="file-status">[ ACCESS DENIED ]</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div id="realityToast" class="reality-toast"></div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Core Page Specific Styles */
  .lore-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .lore-eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    min-height: 20px;
  }

  .lore-content {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }
  .lore-content p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .lore-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .archive-heading {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .archive-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .archive-file {
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--neumorph-out-sm);
    transition:
      box-shadow 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease;
  }
  .archive-file.unlocked {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .archive-file.unlocked:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--neumorph-in-sm);
  }
  .archive-file.locked {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.6;
    box-shadow: var(--neumorph-flat);
  }

  .file-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr 1.5fr;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }
  .file-id {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .file-name {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
  }
  .file-status {
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .file-body {
    padding: 0 var(--space-md) var(--space-md);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    display: none;
  }
  .archive-file.expanded .file-body {
    display: block;
  }

  .reality-toast {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: var(--space-xl);
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    z-index: 9999;
    box-shadow: var(--neumorph-out);
  }
  .reality-toast.show {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
  }
</style>

<script>
  let typeTimeout;

  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", () => {
    /* ── TYPED TEXT EFFECT ── */
    const phrases = [
      "A Story.",
      "A Surrender.",
      "A Sunrise.",
      "A Sanctuary.",
      "A Synthesis.",
    ];
    let pi = 0,
      ci = 0,
      del = false;
    const typedEl = document.getElementById("typed-lore");

    if (typeTimeout) clearTimeout(typeTimeout);

    function type() {
      if (!typedEl) return;
      const p = phrases[pi];
      typedEl.textContent = del ? p.slice(0, ci--) : p.slice(0, ci++);
      if (!del && ci > p.length) {
        del = true;
        typeTimeout = setTimeout(type, 1800);
        return;
      }
      if (del && ci < 0) {
        del = false;
        ci = 0;
        pi = (pi + 1) % phrases.length;
      }
      typeTimeout = setTimeout(type, del ? 38 : 65);
    }
    type();

    /* ── ARCHIVE INTERACTIONS ── */
    const toast = document.getElementById("realityToast");
    let toastTimeout;

    function showToast(message) {
      if (!toast) return;
      clearTimeout(toastTimeout);
      toast.textContent = message;
      toast.classList.add("show");
      toastTimeout = setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove("show"), 2400);
    }

    document.querySelectorAll(".archive-file").forEach((file) => {
      file.addEventListener("click", function () {
        if (this.classList.contains("locked")) {
          showToast("ACCESS DENIED: DATA CORRUPTED");
          // small shake effect
          this.style.transform = "translateX(4px)";
          setTimeout(() => (this.style.transform = "translateX(-4px)"), 50);
          setTimeout(() => (this.style.transform = "translateX(0)"), 100);
        } else if (this.classList.contains("unlocked")) {
          this.classList.toggle("expanded");
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script>
